style=\"color: #ff9900;\">Sch\u00e9ma interactions certifications CEFRI<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.cefri.fr\/certification-entreprise\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><strong>certification de type \u00ab\u00a0E\u00a0\u00bb<\/strong><\/a> &#8211; pour les Entreprises employant du personnel de cat\u00e9gorie A et B travaillant dans les installations nucl\u00e9aires, <a href=\"https:\/\/www.cefri.fr\/content\/uploads\/2016\/09\/Logigramme-EI.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span style=\"color: #ff9900;\"><em>Logigramme simplifi\u00e9 de certification des Entreprises<\/em><\/span><\/a><\/li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.cefri.fr\/certification-entreprise-de-travail-temporaire\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><strong>certification de type \u00ab\u00a0I\u00a0\u00bb<\/strong> <\/a>&#8211; pour les Entreprises de Travail Temporaire mettant \u00e0 disposition du personnel de cat\u00e9gorie A et B pour travailler dans les installations nucl\u00e9aires, <a href=\"https:\/\/www.cefri.fr\/content\/uploads\/2016\/09\/Logigramme-EI.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><em><span style=\"color: #ff9900;\">Logigramme simplifi\u00e9 de certification des Entreprises de Travail Temporaire<\/span><\/em><\/a><\/li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.cefri.fr\/certification-formation\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><strong>certification de type \u00ab\u00a0F\u00a0\u00bb<\/strong><\/a> &#8211; pour les Organismes de Formation dispensant des formations aux personnels intervenant dans des \u00e9tablissements comportant au moins une INB ou une installation individuelle dans le p\u00e9rim\u00e8tre d\u2019une INBS,\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/www.cefri.fr\/content\/uploads\/2016\/09\/Logigramme-OF.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><em><span style=\"color: #ff9900;\">Logigramme simplifi\u00e9 de certification des Organismes de Formation<\/span><\/em><\/a><\/li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.cefri.fr\/certification-ofpcr\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><strong>certification de type \u00ab\u00a0R\u00a0\u00bb<\/strong><\/a> &#8211; pour les Organismes de Formation de Personnes Comp\u00e9tentes en Radioprotection.<\/li>\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/www.cefri.fr\/certification-organismes-competents-en-radioprotection-ocr\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><strong>certification de type \u00ab\u00a0OCR\u00a0\u00bb<\/strong><\/a> &#8211; pour les Organismes Comp\u00e9tents en Radioprotection.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong><em><span style=\"color: #ff9900; text-decoration: underline;\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.cefri.fr\/content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/20230912-20220503-fonctionnement-du-CEFRI.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\u2666\u2666\u00a0Visualiser le fonctionnement du CEFRI<\/a>\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/www.cefri.fr\/content\/uploads\/2016\/08\/20160817-Organisation-du-CEFRI.pdf\">\u2666<\/a><a href=\"https:\/\/www.cefri.fr\/content\/uploads\/2016\/08\/20160817-Organisation-du-CEFRI.pdf\">\u2666<\/a><\/span><\/em><\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n[\/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\u00a0\u00bb.vc_custom_1471537651936{margin-top: 30px !important;margin-bottom: 30px !important;}\u00a0\u00bb][\/vc_column_text][\/vc_column][\/vc_row]\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>[vc_row][vc_column][vc_column_text] Notre fonctionnement [\/vc_column_text][vc_empty_space][vc_column_text] Le CEFRI d\u00e9livre des certificats de soci\u00e9t\u00e9s. Les certificats d\u00e9livr\u00e9s pour les Entreprises, les Entreprises de Travail Temporaire et les Organismes de Formation dispensant des formations aux personnels intervenant dans des \u00e9tablissements comportant au moins une INB ou une installation individuelle dans le p\u00e9rim\u00e8tre d\u2019une INBS sont valables 3 ans \u00e0<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"parent":27,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-129","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.cefri.fr\/json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/129","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.cefri.fr\/json\/wp\/v2\/pages"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.cefri.fr\/json\/wp\/v2\/types\/page"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.cefri.fr\/json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.cefri.fr\/json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=129"}],"version-history":[{"count":3,"href":"https:\/\/www.cefri.fr\/json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/129\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":5385,"href":"https:\/\/www.cefri.fr\/json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/129\/revisions\/5385"}],"up":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.cefri.fr\/json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/27"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.cefri.fr\/json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=129"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}